sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as ChatPage
  participant API as chatApi
  participant Auth as protect Middleware
  participant C as chatController
  participant CM as ChatConversation Model
  participant MM as ChatMessage Model
  participant PM as Product Model
  UI->>API: createOrGetConversation(productId)
  API->>Auth: POST /api/chats/conversations
  Auth->>C: createOrGetConversation
  C->>PM: verify product and seller
  C->>CM: findOrCreate conversation
  CM-->>UI: conversation
  UI->>C: send text / bargain
  C->>MM: create pending message
  UI->>C: seller accepts or rejects
  C->>MM: update once + create system message
  MM-->>UI: final request status
